implementation of the council engine (docs/decisions.md lists the changes).
smartsavant-core is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Third-party code
----------------

None. The Python package and the Node.js, Go, Rust, Java, C#, PHP and Ruby
ports use only their language's standard library (and, for PHP, the bundled
mbstring and pcre extensions).
